{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25271","headline":"晚眺 · 汪万於","name":"晚眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杖策倚柴门，泉声隔岸闻。\n夕阳诸岭出，晴雪万山分。\n静对豺狼窟，幽观鹿豕羣。\n今宵寒月近，东北埽浮云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汪万於","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}